@startuml
' Dependencies relevant to deletion snapshots and project restoration.
!pragma layout smetana
hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class CommandHandler
class TrashcanCommandHandler
class ClientManager
class ProjectManager
class TrashcanManager
class Project
class Client
class Task
class Event

CommandHandler --> TrashcanCommandHandler : delegates
TrashcanCommandHandler --> TrashcanManager : lists / restores
TrashcanCommandHandler --> ProjectManager : supplies\nrestore target
ClientManager --> TrashcanManager : stores deleted\nclients
ProjectManager --> TrashcanManager : stores deleted\nprojects
TrashcanManager ..> ProjectManager : registerRestoredProject(...)

TrashcanManager --> "0..*" Project : retained snapshots
TrashcanManager --> "0..*" Client : retained snapshots
Project *-- "0..*" Task
Project *-- "0..*" Event

note bottom of TrashcanManager
  One shared instance per application.
  Active collections and utility classes are omitted.
end note
@enduml
